            <note corresp="#d279-f1" n="46" xml:id="d279-f1-content">
                <p>For President Roosevelt’s proposal, see memoranda by the Acting Secretary of
                    State, July 24 and 31, 1941, <ref target="frus1931-41v02#pg_527">
